Findings
--------
F1 [Blocker] gates.sh: the disk-space errno match is over-broad (attack i).
has_infra_output (measure/tracks/vinext-oxc-toolchain_20261114/gates.sh:27)
matches the word anywhere in a job log, so a real failure whose text only
mentions the word is classified infrastructure and the gate exits 3, and
key() (gates.sh:45) drops the line, so the compare can print NEWFAIL=0
while a new failure exists. The over-classification guard of the Green
commit ('still reports a normal TS2322 line as a new failure') covers only
a line without the word. Rationale: section 2 of the strategy promises that
a pre-existing failure never makes the aggregate green; the word-drop breaks
that promise for one diagnostic class, and the repo's own errno test titles
(vinext-oxc-gates-script.test.ts:352,361) are the live trigger of the false
INFRA. Fix owner: Green.

F2 [Major] the strategy-mandated subset assertion was absent. Strategy
16.3 case 5 says 'TSC_FALLBACK_LIST is a subset of TYPESCRIPT_KEEP_LIST
(added assertion)' and plan line 413 repeats it, but no test at 5d91443c
asserted it; only comments claimed it. A fallback entry outside the keep
set would have passed case 1 and case 5. Closed in cb3d1ba1 by adv 2.

F3 [Major] no test pinned the root tsc bin shadow (attack f). Green proved
the alias with commands in evidence section 9, but a later install that drops
or reorders the `@typescript/native` link flips `npx tsc` to 6.0.3 and no
test would fail. Closed in cb3d1ba1 by adv 4 (declaration, live version, bin
link).

F4 [Nit] case 1 accepted weakened fallback scripts. The fallback branch used
includes('tsc --noEmit'), so `tsc --noEmit --skipLibCheck` and `npx tsc
--noEmit` passed while the plan (line 389) says the four apps 'keep tsc
--noEmit', one exact string. Hardened to exact equality in cb3d1ba1 through
typecheckScriptFault. The real tree already held the exact form, so no
Green behavior changed.

F5 [Nit] the workflow file set was unpinned. The case 4 sentinel reads the
same readdir list as the scan loop, so a workflow file deleted from the
disk shrank both lists and no test failed; validate-ci.mjs pins only ci.yml
and cloudflare-deploy.yml. Closed in cb3d1ba1 by the adv 7 five-file pin.

